A security-focused release.

• Private keys are protected by a passphrase you choose, and sealed behind your fingerprint or device PIN
• Choose how long a passphrase is remembered: until the screen turns off, an hour, or a day
• Privacy mode keeps the app out of screenshots and recents, blocks overlays, and stops the keyboard learning what you type
• Export a private key after authenticating
• Delete your own keys, with confirmation

Alpha software. Not audited.
